eft;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="c428"><mxGeometry x="230" y="1296" width="1300" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="fig07" name="07 Query router + rewrite"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1400" background="#FFFFFF" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c621" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E3E7ED;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=16;spacingTop=10;fontSize=26;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1F3A5F;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="1760" height="1130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c622" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 7.&lt;/b&gt; Query router &amp;amp; rewrite. Once per user turn, before the supervisor: &lt;b&gt;Jev-1.14&lt;/b&gt; classifies the current message as &lt;i&gt;respond&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;retrieve&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;mixed&lt;/i&gt;; for retrieve / mixed &lt;b&gt;DeepSeek Flash&lt;/b&gt; (models.query_rewriter, reasoning off) fills only &lt;font face='Courier New'&gt;retrieval_query&lt;/font&gt;; the hook then appends a fixed per-turn template to the unchanged user text. Within an 8 s budget any timeout, provider error or invalid schema falls back to the raw message; cancellation and quota rejection still propagate. It targets problem C19: feedback about the assistant was being searched as a quoted line. Dialogue in (a) is illustrative." style="text=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#2B2B2B;fontSize=17;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1180" width="1760" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c623" value="Chat starts with Jev: query router &amp;amp; rewrite before t